  landing/, marketing/     → homepage sections, nav, footer
  legal/                   → shared legal page layout
  ui/                      → the design-system primitives (reuse, don't reinvent)
lib/
  store.ts                 → session (auth/plan/credits/theme), toasts, dev switcher
  workspace-store.ts       → bots, runs, presets, notifications (persisted)
  builder-store.ts         → canvas editing state (undo/redo, selection, tool)
