**Important, and easy to miss:** `mock/data.ts` already defines full mock datasets for several pages that were never built — `MY_PRESETS`, `PLANS` + `PLAN_COMPARISON`, `INVOICES`, `PAYMENT_METHODS`, `CREDIT_BUNDLES`, `PUBLISHED_PRESETS` + `CREATOR_EARNINGS`, `SESSIONS`, `API_KEYS`, `NOTIFICATION_EVENTS`, `DOC_SECTIONS`, `BLOG_POSTS`. Several existing notifications and activity-feed entries already link to routes like `/app/library/regime-tagger` and `/app/creator/dashboard` that don't exist. Phase 5 is mostly about building the UI these already-written datasets are waiting for — it is not starting from zero.

